          "body": "Stops shipping the docs inside the npm package to make it smaller.\n\n- `build.config.ts`: removed the `end()` hook that exported `./docs` into `dist/docs` with mdzilla.\n- `package.json` / lockfile: removed the `mdzilla` dev dependency.\n- `bin/h3.mjs`: `h3 docs [page]` now opens `https://h3.dev/<page>` with the system's open command (`open` / `xdg-open` / `cmd /c start`). If no browser can be launched, it prints the URL instead.\n- `test/unit/cli.test.ts`: replaced the old tests for the bundled docs folder with a test that checks the CLI points at h3.dev.\n\nNote: mdzilla's `--page <path>` flag is gone; use a plain page argument instead (`h3 docs /guide`).\n\nVerified: `pnpm build` produces no `dist/docs`; the CLI test, lint and typecheck pass.\n\n🤖 Generated with AI assistant",
